<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Cos Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Cos Financial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities analyst John Heffern cut his rating on United Cos Financial Corp to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- &quot;From a market perspective, United Companies is clearly in the penalty box after having consistently disappointed investors throughout 1996,&quot; Heffern said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 7/8 at 27-3/4.</p>
</text>
